          "description": "simpleMatch's leading-literal check (pattern.startsWith(str.substring(0, firstIndex))) is dropped, so a pattern whose literal prefix differs from the string's matches when the rest does. It breaks decision preservation and the Javadoc oracle at \"abc*\" against \"xbcdef\"."
